    "excerpt": "Many brands treat organic content as a free version of paid content — the same piece, just without budget behind it — and that's exactly why it underperforms on both sides. These are two tools with different objectives: organic content builds audience and trust over time, without paying for its reach; paid content buys reach directed at a specific audience to generate a measurable action. Understanding that difference is what lets you get the most out of each one.",
